1
00:00:01,001 --> 00:00:07,774
(Yamanaka) Everyone, the title of our debut song is “Eternal” NOTE Eternal

2
00:00:07,774 --> 00:00:10,911
(Imagawa) Kita, if the debut song has been decided

3
00:00:10,911 --> 00:00:13,647
That's what I should do next.

4
00:00:13,647 --> 00:00:15,983
(Fukuko) We're going to shoot the music video for "Eternal"

5
00:00:15,983 --> 00:00:17,985
(Sanada) Huh? (Asai) Oh NOTE Sanada

6
00:00:17,985 --> 00:00:21,989
⚟♬『Eternal』

7
00:00:21,989 --> 00:00:48,916
⚟♬～

8
00:00:48,916 --> 00:00:52,019
It's like an idol photoshoot

9
00:00:52,019 --> 00:00:56,190
We're not just like idols.

10
00:00:56,190 --> 00:00:59,526
I'm so impressed by how authentic it is...

11
00:00:59,526 --> 00:01:03,463
That's true, he's a first-class gentleman like a gentleman.

12
00:01:03,463 --> 00:01:05,666
We're using the same studio, right?

13
00:01:05,666 --> 00:01:07,668
Is it the same as Gentlemen?

14
00:01:07,668 --> 00:01:10,003
Ou

15
00:01:10,003 --> 00:01:12,005
(Ishida) Huh...

16
00:01:28,021 --> 00:01:32,025
⚟♬『Eternal』

17
00:01:32,025 --> 00:01:50,043
⚟♬～

18
00:01:51,678 --> 00:01:55,315
(Staff) Yes, the current cut is okay.

19
00:01:55,315 --> 00:01:58,719
(Asai) Alright!

20
00:01:58,719 --> 00:02:01,755
Um, is this really okay?

21
00:02:01,755 --> 00:02:04,358
Huh? (Ishida) Aren't you compromising?

22
00:02:04,358 --> 00:02:08,529
Somehow, I don't feel a soul. (Staff) A soul?

23
00:02:08,529 --> 00:02:13,433
Yes, it's my soul...my passionate feelings

24
00:02:13,433 --> 00:02:16,069
It won't arrive like this!

25
00:02:16,069 --> 00:02:18,772
(Staff) Sigh...

26
00:02:18,772 --> 00:02:24,511
Ishida... you have such passionate feelings...

27
00:02:24,511 --> 00:02:27,514
Okay, let's do it again.

28
00:02:27,514 --> 00:02:30,918
As many times as we want until our feelings are conveyed

29
00:02:30,918 --> 00:02:34,054
Okay, let's do it.

30
00:02:37,491 --> 00:02:40,494
Thanks to Ishida, thank you.

31
00:02:40,494 --> 00:02:44,064
(Ishida) I was just saying something obvious.

32
00:02:45,465 --> 00:02:48,035
(knock) Yes

33
00:02:48,035 --> 00:02:50,037
Someone will use it next time.

34
00:02:50,037 --> 00:02:52,039
Can I have you come out now?

35
00:02:52,039 --> 00:02:54,041
Sorry, I'll leave right away

36
00:02:57,110 --> 00:02:59,112
(Souta) I'm sorry, but I made a note. That's right.

37
00:03:03,750 --> 00:03:06,787
Nice to meet you, I'm Soda from Gentlemen.

38
00:03:06,787 --> 00:03:09,489
Are you guys eternal boys? NOTE Eternal Boys

39
00:03:09,489 --> 00:03:12,759
That's right, he knew... (Souta) Of course.

40
00:03:12,759 --> 00:03:15,963
I saw “I tried dancing” Thank you so much

41
00:03:15,963 --> 00:03:18,932
Is that photo okay? I like the photo (Souta). Let's take a photo.

42
00:03:18,932 --> 00:03:20,934
(Imagawa) Huh!

43
00:03:20,934 --> 00:03:27,641
♬～

44
00:03:27,641 --> 00:03:30,744
Look, Issy, hurry up (Ishida).I'm fine.

45
00:03:30,744 --> 00:03:32,746
I don't know much about Gentlemen.

46
00:03:32,746 --> 00:03:35,415
You're rude. I'm going home. Thank you for your hard work.

47
00:03:35,415 --> 00:03:37,417
(Asai) Hey... Mr. Ishida...

48
00:03:37,417 --> 00:03:39,419
What is it? Sorry

49
00:03:39,419 --> 00:03:43,023
Not at all What should I do? Well...

50
00:03:43,023 --> 00:03:45,125
Well then, do you know my signature pose?

51
00:03:45,125 --> 00:03:47,127
Ah, it's out

52
00:03:47,127 --> 00:03:50,764
Yes, let's go, yes, cheese (shutter sound)

53
00:03:54,201 --> 00:04:12,019
(snore)

54
00:04:13,687 --> 00:04:20,861
(footsteps)

55
00:04:32,206 --> 00:04:34,641
♬With light steps

56
00:04:34,641 --> 00:04:40,080
♬Let's dance with me too

57
00:04:40,080 --> 00:04:42,082
(Gotou) Yay!

58
00:04:42,082 --> 00:04:44,785
Mr. Goto... (Everyone) Ah, fuuu!

59
00:04:44,785 --> 00:04:47,554
(Gen Ota) Even the tin badge is complete...

60
00:04:47,554 --> 00:04:49,723
Isn't that a lie? This is really new too...

61
00:04:49,723 --> 00:04:52,359
This too! Ah, everything is wonderful

62
00:04:52,359 --> 00:04:55,329
This color... Jen Otamaru Megapyon

63
00:04:55,329 --> 00:04:58,599
What is it? Mr. Goto, please listen without being surprised.

64
00:04:59,867 --> 00:05:02,870
Gentle…

65
00:05:02,870 --> 00:05:05,606
You might be able to breathe the same air as the gentlemen!

66
00:05:05,606 --> 00:05:09,276
Yeah! It's a divine development kitakore

67
00:05:09,276 --> 00:05:11,678
What's going on?

68
00:05:14,848 --> 00:05:18,452
(Ishida) "A certain famous idol who belongs to Twilight Production"?

69
00:05:18,452 --> 00:05:20,454
That's definitely only for gentlemen

70
00:05:20,454 --> 00:05:23,457
You're not there, right? Yes, that's right.

71
00:05:24,992 --> 00:05:27,594
Driver? yes

72
00:05:31,999 --> 00:05:36,303
Hey! What happened?

73
00:05:36,303 --> 00:05:38,372
It's nothing

74
00:05:38,372 --> 00:05:51,652
♬～

75
00:05:51,652 --> 00:05:55,889
Can I take a break from voice training on Thursday?

76
00:05:55,889 --> 00:05:57,891
Is there something like that?

77
00:05:57,891 --> 00:06:00,561
My stomach hasn't been feeling well lately.

78
00:06:00,561 --> 00:06:03,263
Are you okay with going to the hospital?

79
00:06:03,263 --> 00:06:06,733
You don't need to rest at all, just get a proper checkup.

80
00:06:06,733 --> 00:06:08,735
thank you

81
00:06:08,735 --> 00:06:17,177
♬～

82
00:06:17,177 --> 00:06:21,548
What I value is honesty.

83
00:06:21,548 --> 00:06:24,218
Face any job with sincerity... NOTE Shinshi

84
00:06:24,218 --> 00:06:27,254
(Interviewer) Um... yes.

85
00:06:27,254 --> 00:06:30,457
Actually, there was a vacancy for another person yesterday.

86
00:06:30,457 --> 00:06:34,494
It's urgent, but could you please come next week?

87
00:06:42,436 --> 00:06:45,606
Okay, let's start with "Eternal".

88
00:06:45,606 --> 00:06:47,608
(Asai) Okay then, about the first position.

89
00:06:47,608 --> 00:06:50,210
Yes Ishida

90
00:06:50,210 --> 00:06:53,313
Hey Ishida

91
00:06:53,313 --> 00:06:55,949
Ah, excuse me, are you okay?

92
00:06:55,949 --> 00:06:57,951
yes

93
00:06:57,951 --> 00:07:00,087
Well then, shall we go?

94
00:07:00,087 --> 00:07:02,322
I'll play a song

95
00:07:03,957 --> 00:07:08,428
⚟♬『Eternal』

96
00:07:13,967 --> 00:07:18,906
Is it really okay? Yeah

97
00:07:18,906 --> 00:07:26,046
I feel like this is probably the secret behind Issy's strange behavior...

98
00:07:26,046 --> 00:07:28,282
“I feel like it”?

99
00:07:40,761 --> 00:07:42,763
Did you see it?

100
00:07:43,764 --> 00:07:47,835
(Kakizaki) So, why did Ishida join Eternal Shonen?

101
00:07:47,835 --> 00:07:53,707
To be a gentleman...do you mean to get closer to Soda-kun?

102
00:07:53,707 --> 00:07:56,410
yes

103
00:07:56,410 --> 00:08:02,482
But if I become your exclusive driver, I'll be able to take you closer to Souda...

104
00:08:02,482 --> 00:08:05,586
The same atmosphere as Souda...

105
00:08:05,586 --> 00:08:10,490
Huh? Then why did you take the photo the other day...

106
00:08:10,490 --> 00:08:13,360
Don't you love it? It's not like I love you!

107
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:16,763
Since the summer of my first year of junior high school when I first found Souda-kun.

108
00:08:16,763 --> 00:08:20,000
My soul is with Soda-kun.

109
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:22,135
soul? (Ishida) It's the soul.

110
00:08:22,135 --> 00:08:27,641
My passion for Gentleman Souda is...

111
00:08:27,641 --> 00:08:29,710
It's like this...

112
00:08:33,881 --> 00:08:39,119
What Issy was looking at wasn't Eternal Boy...

113
00:08:46,894 --> 00:08:48,896
Ishida...

114
00:08:54,401 --> 00:08:56,470
Live as you like

115
00:08:58,105 --> 00:09:00,107
Huh?

116
00:09:00,107 --> 00:09:03,911
Supporting the things the members like

117
00:09:03,911 --> 00:09:06,847
We are eternal boys

118
00:09:06,847 --> 00:09:15,789
♬～

119
00:09:17,891 --> 00:09:23,096
(Gen Ota) Megapyon-dono… (Ishida) Jen Ota Maru…

120
00:09:26,333 --> 00:09:30,838
Megapyon... (Ishida) Mr. Goto...

121
00:09:30,838 --> 00:09:33,574
(cry)

122
00:09:33,574 --> 00:09:35,909
Are you sure we can't meet again?

123
00:09:38,846 --> 00:09:43,417
I'm probably going to be very busy from now on.

124
00:09:43,417 --> 00:09:45,519
(Gotou) Megapyon! (Gen Ota) Megapyon-dono!

125
00:09:45,519 --> 00:09:50,257
(Gotou) Mega pyon... Mega pyon...

126
00:10:16,016 --> 00:10:19,953
I just packed my bags

127
00:10:19,953 --> 00:10:22,422
I'm really leaving

128
00:10:25,959 --> 00:10:29,329
Is it okay? I can't stop it

129
00:10:29,329 --> 00:10:31,331
It's okay

130
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:35,269
This is good

131
00:10:41,775 --> 00:10:43,777
Ishida...

132
00:10:45,179 --> 00:10:47,714
Is it coming out yet?

133
00:10:50,317 --> 00:10:55,989
Could you please keep this?

134
00:10:55,989 --> 00:10:59,393
I want to stand on the same stage as the gentlemen.

135
00:10:59,393 --> 00:11:07,467
As an idol, I will seal my otaku life until then.

136
00:11:07,467 --> 00:11:14,441
I seem to like Eternal Boy

137
00:11:14,441 --> 00:11:19,012
Well, after Gentlemen.

138
00:11:19,012 --> 00:11:22,149
Hahahahaha

139
00:11:22,149 --> 00:11:25,652
Aren't we the best? It's true.

140
00:11:25,652 --> 00:11:27,788
Ishida-san, look, Issy.

141
00:11:27,788 --> 00:11:33,427
Come quickly (Imagawa) Let's eat hahahahaha

142
00:11:34,494 --> 00:11:36,496
Oh! (Imagawa) Kitakita

143
00:11:36,496 --> 00:11:38,498
(Asai) As expected! Mr. Nikolai

144
00:11:38,498 --> 00:11:40,601
thank you

145
00:11:40,601 --> 00:11:42,603
Let's eat, let's eat, let's eat, let's eat

146
00:11:43,604 --> 00:11:45,873
(Asai) Delicious!

147
00:11:45,873 --> 00:11:48,509
Delicious (Imagawa) Delicious

148
00:11:48,509 --> 00:11:50,644
I never want to lose to them

149
00:11:50,644 --> 00:11:53,180
I have something I want to talk to everyone about.

150
00:11:53,180 --> 00:11:57,417
Asai's secret will be the secret of all eternal boys from today onwards.

151
00:11:57,417 --> 00:12:00,020
(Asai/Imagawa) Aiko! (All) Hahahaha

152
00:12:00,020 --> 00:12:03,590
(Together) Eternal youth!

153
00:12:03,590 --> 00:12:05,993
Hahahaha, it's big Kaoru
